## 5. ORDINARY MODEL SELECTION

For each enabled provider:

- Select only models belonging to that provider.
- Select only models with `test_status == "untested"`.
- Preserve the existing model order inside the catalog.
- Preserve existing model initialization and status updates.
- Preserve `current_model_key` behavior.

The selected provider must be the provider represented by the current dynamic rotation group.

An empty provider group must be skipped without breaking the rotation.

Do not select ordinary models from disabled providers.

